cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "growthz: batch-compute CDC growth z-scores and percentiles from a CSV of child measurements"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/growthz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/growthz"
abstract: >-
  Batch-computes CDC growth z-scores and percentiles for a CSV of
  child measurements (weight, length, height, head circumference,
  BMI) using the CDC LMS method and the CDC's own published LMS
  tables, bundled verbatim so it runs offline. Research and
  educational tool only; not a medical device. Arithmetic against
  published tables only: no diagnosis, interpretation or
  recommendation.
keywords:
  - growth charts
  - z-scores
  - CDC
  - LMS method
  - child growth
